From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:20:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Amity Square's cells sent in their lists' order; copies lit
 as the maps (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Patch 0111 sent each shape's list made of its cells' parts one cell after
another, and the lamp posts' bulbs came out grey or lavender instead of
white, turning "on" and "off" as the player walked by (as the cells in
the view changed). Two things: two polygons in one place in two cells
were drawn the other way round, and a lamp's quad strips start with a
vertex without a normal of its own (it takes the last one's colour),
the one before it often another lamp's, in another cell, not sent.

Each shape's list is now cut once into runs (its polygons one after
another in one cell: NitroPort_Gx3dSurveyRuns, all in one pass), each
run its own list drawing them as the whole list does at that point: its
BEGIN_VTXS, then the colour, normal and texture coordinates set before
it (after the BEGIN_VTXS: a NORMAL's colour is worked out with the
lights of the polygon attributes latched at the BEGIN before it, so
before it the shape's own lights weren't on yet and the bulbs were lit
as the shape before), its first vertex as its own coordinates. Each
scene's list is made of the runs in the view in the list's order, then
what the whole list leaves set, in a BEGIN_VTXS of its own (a shape
after it without a colour of its own takes it). On the PC every place
looked at in Amity Square draws as with the maps sent whole (the lamps
white), with 7.0 to 7.7k vertices a scene by the lake as before (15k
sent whole).

The copies drawn past a map's edge (0110) and the cells' copies (0111)
were copies of the loaded map's model file, and the game sets a map's
model to the time of day's light (AreaLight_UseGlobalModelAttributes) a
scene or two after it's loaded: a copy made before that kept the model's
own colours, darker (Amity Square's trees past its east edge, and its
rocks' rows past the west one, a different colour from the map beside
them on the 3DS, 2026-11-07). The copies made outdoors are set to it too
now, as they're made.
